{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"15395","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v20274","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c35917","characterName":"羽二重 朝緋","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"25452","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"14234"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11161"],"vndbCharacterId":"c35917"},"originalCharacterName":"羽二重 朝緋","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"極堂院の分家の中でも最大の勢力を誇る羽二重の一人娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"朝緋の祖父の羽二重楊柳は、悠一の祖父である次雄の親友で、ともに極道伝説を築いた大人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その楊柳の薫陶（とうくん）を受けた朝緋は、義侠心に篤い生粋の極道娘として育った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"凄腕の剣士で、眼前に立ちふさがるあらゆるものを斬り伏せる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11161","sourceWorkId":"14459","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"言行举止可以说是『站如芍药 坐如牡丹 行如百合』的楚楚动人少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思考方式有点古老如热血汉子般的，有时会露出直性子的一面，但基本是悠闲自得样子温柔体贴的性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋爱方面是一条心精神可嘉。是为人着想的类型。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「我认为我的职责就是为了让悠一下定决心而作为妻子支撑着家主」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"25452"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/7219c7d780ff46a8b3be5928fa1e53a72a9061f14bac874cd17044ad1e4e1f38.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f650572c7b9e11077f152d4e682b4109c77d93d8bb9c7de2024b2f01046f3b4e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c35925","characterName":"極堂院 悠一","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["11166"],"vndbCharacterId":"c35925"},"originalCharacterName":"極堂院 悠一","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"極道一家『極堂院一家』の跡取り息子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人はごく普通の学生で、自分が極道の家系だという認識は薄い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物心つく前に、祖父と交わした『盃』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伝説と呼ばれた祖父との盃の所為で全世界を巻き込んだ跡目争いに巻き込まれていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"極道ヒロイン達との同棲生活でだんだんと「漢気」を開花させていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親不在の為、家事全般と料理が得意。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11166","sourceWorkId":"14459","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/19/19d16df51984c907af63bb4c7b65401205b9224a6cb67a2a8f304e87ad5eb4be.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/6152e852a73b11256088f21be6167cb27c5bbb3e8e2d0879d011a3082a05f79d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c35936","characterName":"鶴田 宏","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c35936"},"originalCharacterName":"鶴田 宏","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4e499263700182f89d32fc15b32a3f916749c9c71fc76862f8737c483521fba9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e54cd3db4b187ee8c3ea5260f95950410b6f61cf21e4bc543ed71000dcfb0ac6.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c35937","characterName":"秀","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c35937"},"originalCharacterName":"秀","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"sourc